OLD CVS/

# Private contact details for the application CVs — phone, email, location. The repo
# is public: this file must never be committed. _cv-private.example.yml is the template.
/_cv-private.yml
# Quarto's intermediate Typst source for a CV, which carries those same details if a
# failed render leaves it behind. The style file is the only .typ that is source.
/cv/*.typ
!/cv/_typst-style.typ
